SPOILER FOLLOWS:


Effects of donating gold to (co-aligned) Priest/ess (Taken from
the source code for 3.0i):

0:	"Thou shalt regret thine action!"	
            alignment decreases by 1

1 to  200 * level:
    if you give less than half of your gold:
	"Cheapskate", but nothing bad happens.
    If you give more than  half of your gold:
	"I thank you for thy contribution", but nothing else happens.

from 200 * level to 400 * level:
    "Thou art indeed a pious individual"
    If you give more than half of your gold, you get
    Clairvoyant for 500 - 1000 turns.  Also, if your
    alignment is really bad, it gets better by 1.

from 400 * level to 600 * level:
    "Thy devotion has been rewarded"
    If you aren't already Protected, you get Protection intrinsic,
    and get from 1 to 3 points of protection.  If already Protected,
    you get 1.  But watch out, all of the priest generated
    protection points are wiped out if you make your god angry.

more than 600 * level:
    "Thy selfless generosity is deeply appreciated"
    If you donated more than half of your gold, you will be re-aligned
    to neutral if you have strayed, or your alignment will increase
    by +2 if you are in good standing with your god.


